  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.36,
      "end": 2.4,
      "text": "Morevna Project..."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.88,
      "end": 7,
      "text": "...in association with \"Adamant\" Art School of Gorno-Altaisk..."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.44,
      "end": 9.24,
      "text": "presents"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.4,
      "end": 30.4,
      "text": "\"Falcon\", \"Falcon\", respond. This is \"Hawk\". What's your status?"
    },
    {
      "start": 55,
      "end": 57.68,
      "text": "Hey officer, can I help you somehow?"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.92,
      "end": 61.56,
      "text": "Stay away, stay away!"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.72,
      "end": 63.6,
      "text": "I am a government agent!"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.56,
      "end": 67.12,
      "text": "I know, I know..."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.84,
      "end": 70.56,
      "text": "And I am the owner of this mansion."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.96,
      "end": 78.96,
      "text": "Episode 3: Underground"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.48,
      "end": 105.04,
      "text": "Ah, Marya Morevna, I just don't get it. We aren't that rich..."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.8,
      "end": 109.56,
      "text": "...but they are coming here like bees to a..."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.8,
      "end": 111.36,
      "text": "...honeypot!"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.8,
      "end": 113.56,
      "text": "I am not a bee, I am a \"Hawk\"."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.84,
      "end": 115.6,
      "text": "Spread your wings, Hawk."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.36,
      "end": 120.36,
      "text": "But it seems like you're having fun."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.64,
      "end": 122.2,
      "text": "Of course I am!"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.64,
      "end": 125.16,
      "text": "But still, why did you drop my favorite toolbox on him?"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.16,
      "end": 144.72,
      "text": "I just can't figure out what you did to them if they're after you so much..."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.16,
      "end": 147.16,
      "text": "I have no idea."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.72,
      "end": 149.28,
      "text": "Going somewhere?"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.6,
      "end": 152.24,
      "text": "I am going to a biker party, and I won't be back until tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.44,
      "end": 155.16,
      "text": "Dinner on plate, firewood in shed, dog food under sink..."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.44,
      "end": 156.68,
      "text": "Do we have dogs here?"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.92,
      "end": 161.68,
      "text": "...in case of a power outage, turn on the electric generator and don't forget to restart the air defense system."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.88,
      "end": 164.12,
      "text": "Here are the keys to all of the doors in the mansion."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.24,
      "end": 168.56,
      "text": "Feel free to go anywhere, but don't touch this key and don't unlock the door."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.84,
      "end": 169.6,
      "text": "But why?"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.84,
      "end": 172.16,
      "text": "Just don't!"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.36,
      "end": 175.12,
      "text": "Well, bye..."
    },
    {
      "start": 191.2,
      "end": 195.76,
      "text": "So dear, now I can have some fun with you then."
    },
    {
      "start": 233,
      "end": 235.44,
      "text": "Hm, it seems this lovely evening is in danger."
    },
    {
      "start": 242.36,
      "end": 246.68,
      "text": "Stay here, I'll be right back."
    },
    {
      "start": 248.68,
      "end": 251.24,
      "text": "Caption on the door: \"Cellar\""
    },
    {
      "start": 277.2,
      "end": 279.4,
      "text": "Aha, here it is!"
    },
    {
      "start": 285.84,
      "end": 287.2,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": 297.72,
      "end": 299.84,
      "text": "Could it be..."
    },
    {
      "start": 303.12,
      "end": 307.08,
      "text": "...feel free to go anywhere, but don't touch this key..."
    },
    {
      "start": 353.32,
      "end": 355.68,
      "text": "Hey, is anybody here?"
    },
    {
      "start": 358.04,
      "end": 360.92,
      "text": "There is something wrong with your engine here."
    },
    {
      "start": 364.32,
      "end": 366.8,
      "text": "Damn you…"
    },
    {
      "start": 367.52,
      "end": 370.36,
      "text": "Ah? Who is it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 374.28,
      "end": 377.32,
      "text": "Come on..."
    },
    {
      "start": 381.52,
      "end": 386.28,
      "text": "My name is Ivan Tsarevich... and I am very good at fixing things."
    },
    {
      "start": 390.04,
      "end": 391.64,
      "text": "Inside..."
    },
    {
      "start": 398.96,
      "end": 401.16,
      "text": "There..."
    },
    {
      "start": 405.12,
      "end": 410.4,
      "text": "The framework is quite unusual. It will be a challenge to get inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 411.8,
      "end": 414.12,
      "text": "So, let's start!"
    },
    {
      "start": 418.24,
      "end": 420.84,
      "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
      "start": 423.92,
      "end": 426.4,
      "text": "Excellent..."
    },
    {
      "start": 428.96,
      "end": 431.12,
      "text": "Well done."
    },
    {
      "start": 434.4,
      "end": 437.6,
      "text": "Certainly, you've got talent..."
    },
    {
      "start": 439.16,
      "end": 442.24,
      "text": "This is not the hardest one..."
    },
    {
      "start": 442.48,
      "end": 446.08,
      "text": "Still, it's quite strange that it's so tricky to open this thing..."
    },
    {
      "start": 452.56,
      "end": 453.72,
      "text": "Well, that's all."
    },
    {
      "start": 454.6,
      "end": 457.24,
      "text": "Open Sesame!"
    },
    {
      "start": 480.72,
      "end": 485.48,
      "text": "What's up? You are almost there!"
    },
    {
      "start": 486.16,
      "end": 494.52,
      "text": "I don't know... there seems to be some piece of paper here... I'm going to remove it now."
    },
    {
      "start": 574.88,
      "end": 576.04,
      "text": "Oh, no..."
    }
  ],
